  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3302.08 Defect",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3302.08 “Defect” means non-compliance that renders the modular building or building component not for the ordinary use for which it was intended, but does not result in an unreasonable risk of injury or death to occupants of the affected modular building or building component.\n\nSource. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
